  "translation": "An ye Midian ka kɛmɛsaraw fila minɛ: ⟨את⟩ Oreb (Oreb) ni ⟨את⟩ Zeeb (Zeeb); an ye ⟨את⟩ Oreb fabɔ Oreb kɔrɔbila kan, ⟨את⟩ Zeeb fana an ye a fabɔ Zeeb ka diwɛn-marabɔlan kɔnɔ. An ye Midianaw tulon, an ye Oreb kun ni Zeeb kunw na Gideon (Gidɛw) fɛ, Yardɛn kɔfɛ.",
